  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sudan Smallholders and Agro-Pastoralists Value Chain Support in the Face of Climate Change</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Objective of the proposed action: To support smallholder farmers, agro pastoralists and pastoralists to more productive, more efficient and more profitable using a sustainable natural resources management approach in the face of climate change.
Result 1: smallholder farmers and agro-pastoralists&#x2019; climate resilient livelihood capacities improved using a youth canter approach
Result 2: Knowledge and institutional capacities for smallholder farmers and agro-pastoralists responsive climate change adaptation and mitigation strengthened 
Result 3: Ecosystem adaptive and mitigation capacities enhanced. 
Result 4 : Improved access to high-quality seeds and expanded outreach to communities.
The proposed intervention will target 20000 smallholder farmers and agro pastoralists and pastoralists in three States (Gedaref, Sennar and White Nile) in Sudan.</narrative>
  </description>
